- The inspector now reads `/api/v1/automation/actions` twice per mount (`useActionConfigSchemas` + `useFlowNodePalette`). A shared read needs an off-surface file → `Acceptance notes`
- Offline, the Node Type list no longer offers `map`, which `NODE_PALETTE` lacks and the engine publishes online → `Acceptance notes`

